{
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:0": "從我懂事以來，\n就一直待在這座浮在空中的島上……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:10": "王者翡翠被……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:11": "是你幹的好事嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:12": "你、你這傢伙幹了什麼好事……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:14": "可惡！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:15": "啊，站住！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:16": "那傢伙到底是什麼東西……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:17": "開始了嗎！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:18": "要是失去了王者翡翠……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:19": "靠它的力量浮在空中的這座島，\n又會掉下去……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:2": "獨自守護著名為王者翡翠的\n巨大寶石……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:4": "理由什麼的，我才不知道。\n只是「本來就是這樣」而已。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:6": "現在……還有今後也是……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:7": "什麼！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:8": "你是……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:9": "啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/02 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:0": "得快點把翡翠的碎片找齊，\n讓王者翡翠復原才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/02 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:2": "可是，翡翠的碎片\n已經飛散到四面八方去了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/02 Before Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:4": "只能一個一個地方找了嗎。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/03 After Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:0": "……這裡是哪裡？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/03 After Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:1": "從來沒見過……不對！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/03 After Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:2": "我知道……？\n我知道這個地方……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/03 After Speed Highway/Japanese.txt:3": "這裡到底是什麼地方！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/04 Tikal 1/Japanese.txt:0": "求求您，請住手！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/04 Tikal 1/Japanese.txt:1": "蒂卡爾……\n為了我族的繁榮，這是必要的……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/04 Tikal 1/Japanese.txt:2": "那七顆翡翠……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/04 Tikal 1/Japanese.txt:3": "您還不滿足嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/04 Tikal 1/Japanese.txt:4": "攻打其他部族，\n搶奪財物、傷害別人……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/04 Tikal 1/Japanese.txt:5": "這種事已經夠了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/04 Tikal 1/Japanese.txt:6": "誰都沒有權利\n奪走他們的聖域！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/04 Tikal 1/Japanese.txt:7": "父親！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/05 Before Casinopolis/Japanese.txt:0": "咦？這裡是……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/05 Before Casinopolis/Japanese.txt:1": "我回到\n車站廣場了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/05 Before Casinopolis/Japanese.txt:2": "這到底是怎麼回事？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/06 Eggman!/Japanese.txt:0": "那不是蛋頭博士嗎。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/06 Eggman!/Japanese.txt:1": "嗯？那個發光的東西是……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/06 Eggman!/Japanese.txt:2": "王者翡翠嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/06 Eggman!/Japanese.txt:3": "啊，給我站住！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "喂，蛋頭博士！\n把王者翡翠還來！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "糟，是納克魯斯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "省得我到處去找了。\n這筆帳我可得好好還你！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:13": "哇哈哈哈哈！\n幹得好，卡歐斯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:14": "怎、怎麼可能……！\n樣子變了……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:15": "……哼，\n這種虛張聲勢對我沒用！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "不、不對！這個\n才不是王者翡翠！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "唔……的確。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "哼，算了。就讓你來當\n試身手的對象吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "卡歐斯？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "那傢伙是……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "雖然感覺有點不太一樣……\n不，絕對沒錯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/07 Before Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "就是翡翠被打碎時的……\n那個傢伙！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "你竟敢這樣！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "……算了。卡歐斯真正的力量\n現在才要開始！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "哇～哈哈哈！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:12": "索尼克他……這是怎麼回事？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "你在嘴硬什麼啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "哦！比起這個……\n我來告訴你一件好事吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "什麼！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "索尼克怎麼了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "那傢伙也在打王者翡翠的主意，\n正到處跑來跑去喔？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "你說什麼！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/08 After Chaos 2 Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "哇～哈哈哈！你應該沒空\n在這種地方摸魚吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/09 Mystic Ruins/Japanese.txt:0": "索尼克在打王者翡翠的主意，\n這件事雖然也讓人在意……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/09 Mystic Ruins/Japanese.txt:1": "總之，\n我只能靠自己去找了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/10 Before Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "啊，是索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/10 Before Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "那個發光的東西是……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/10 Before Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "可惡……就算只有一塊，\n我也絕不會交給你！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/10 Before Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "你幹什麼！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/11 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:15": "可惡！\n我不會就這樣算了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/13 You've got the Shovel Claw/Japanese.txt:0": "是「鏟爪」喔。\n可以在泥土或岩石上「挖洞」。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/13 You've got the Shovel Claw/Japanese.txt:1": "試著同時按下\n跳躍鈕和動作鈕吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/14 Tikal 2 (1)/Japanese.txt:0": "這、這是……！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/14 Tikal 2 (1)/Japanese.txt:1": "到底是怎麼回事……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:0": "欸，你們在吧？\n聽我說！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:1": "父親他們\n馬上就要來這裡了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:2": "這次跟以往不一樣……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:3": "拜託，帶著大家\n逃離這裡吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:4": "求求你們！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:5": "是嗎……你們還是說\n無法離開這裡啊。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:6": "我知道了。我會再去\n和父親談一次。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:7": "希望我能帶回\n好消息……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:8": "沒事的。你們什麼都\n不用擔心喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/15 Tikal 2 (2)/Japanese.txt:9": "得想辦法……得想想辦法才行……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:0": "這裡是……祭壇前面！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:1": "不過……剛才那是怎麼回事？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:10": "可是……要怎麼找？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:11": "蛋頭博士的機器人？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:12": "……對了。只要跟著那傢伙，\n應該就能帶我到基地去。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:13": "去看看吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:2": "……先不管那個了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:3": "王者翡翠的碎片\n已經收回不少了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:4": "先放回祭壇一次吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:5": "還是不夠嗎……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:6": "剩下的碎片\n到底在哪裡……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:8": "這是……蛋頭博士的飛行要塞！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/16 Master Emerald almost restored/Japanese.txt:9": "你是說王者翡翠\n就在這傢伙裡面嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/17 Final Egg entrance/Japanese.txt:0": "就是這裡啊。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/17 Final Egg entrance/Japanese.txt:1": "感謝招待啦。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/18 On Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:0": "嘿嘿，順利溜進來了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/18 On Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:1": "那麼，就來找找\n王者翡翠吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/19 What's going on/Japanese.txt:0": "哇！怎、怎麼了！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/20 This thing's always changing/Japanese.txt:0": "這、這艘船是怎麼了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/21 Before Sky Deck/Japanese.txt:0": "我感覺得到……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/21 Before Sky Deck/Japanese.txt:1": "王者翡翠就在前面！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/22 After Sky Deck/Japanese.txt:0": "終於把碎片全部找齊了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/22 After Sky Deck/Japanese.txt:1": "這樣就能讓王者翡翠\n恢復原狀了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/22 After Sky Deck/Japanese.txt:2": "……嗯？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/23 Tikal 3 (1)/Japanese.txt:0": "又來了嗎……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/23 Tikal 3 (1)/Japanese.txt:1": "這次到底又是什麼……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/24 Tikal 3 (2)/Japanese.txt:0": "喂！妳怎麼了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/24 Tikal 3 (2)/Japanese.txt:1": "我沒能阻止他們……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/24 Tikal 3 (2)/Japanese.txt:2": "父親他們\n終於來到這裡了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/24 Tikal 3 (2)/Japanese.txt:3": "可是，沒想到……\n沒想到會變成這樣……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/24 Tikal 3 (2)/Japanese.txt:4": "不行……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/24 Tikal 3 (2)/Japanese.txt:5": "那、那是……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/24 Tikal 3 (2)/Japanese.txt:6": "喂、喂！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/25 Back on Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:0": "……到底是怎樣？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/25 Back on Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:1": "難道我腦袋出問題了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/26 Chaos 6 Transforms/Japanese.txt:0": "總之，這樣王者翡翠的碎片\n應該全都收集齊了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/26 Chaos 6 Transforms/Japanese.txt:1": "那隻透明的怪物雖然讓人在意……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/27 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "我要讓王者翡翠恢復原狀！\n別想來礙事！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/27 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "本來想跟那傢伙做個了斷，\n結果被搶先了嗎……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/27 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "算了。讓王者翡翠復原\n才是我的本分。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/27 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "什……！\n你又復活了嗎！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/27 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "看來你是不打算\n輕易放我走了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/28 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "成功了嗎！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/28 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "接下來只要把王者翡翠的碎片\n放回祭壇，一切就結束了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/29 Master Emerald Restored/Japanese.txt:0": "這樣就恢復原狀了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/29 Master Emerald Restored/Japanese.txt:1": "王者翡翠也是……\n還有這座島也是……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/30 End/Japanese.txt:0": "今後，我大概也會\n一直待在這座浮在空中的島上吧……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/30 End/Japanese.txt:1": "獨自守護著\n王者翡翠……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/30 End/Japanese.txt:2": "這其中的意義……或許\n還是不要全部知道比較好。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/30 End/Japanese.txt:3": "總覺得一旦知道了，就會發生什麼事……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/31 Now, you've got Fighting Gloves/Japanese.txt:0": "是「戰鬥手套」呢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/31 Now, you've got Fighting Gloves/Japanese.txt:2": "等力量蓄滿之後再放開按鈕……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Knuckles/31 Now, you've got Fighting Gloves/Japanese.txt:3": "就能用必殺技『極限熱力拳』\n發動攻擊喔。"
}